# --- The header-dictionary family (one row per shipped zstd dictionary) ------ #
# Each gmeow:CompressionDictionary individual declared in the gts slice is      #
# pinned in the shipped segment header's in-band "dct" map (GTS spec            #
# §5) — the channel a consumer priming its OWN runtime store reads the bytes    #
# from. The gate projects that entry, and ONLY that entry, onto                 #
# generated/medium/<dict-id>.zdict: routing the same bytes through the          #
# generated-opaque archive as well would carry them twice (Constitution §18     #
# forbids re-folding a blob the snapshot already carries) and would hand        #
# high-entropy bytes to a compressor. These rows are AUTHORED because the       #
# declared dictionary set is stable hand-written data, and the superset gate    #
# bijection-checks them against the header's own "dct" map.                     #

gmeow:fanout-medium-dictionary-effect a gmeow:FanoutExtraction ;
    rdfs:label "fanout medium dictionary effect"@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:definition "Fanout reconstruction row: the committed path generated/medium/dictionary-effect.ttl is rebuilt from the shipped gmeow.gts as a RDF-fanout named-graph fold serialized as canonical Turtle. It is the ONE row of the generated/medium/ family that is NOT a header dictionary: the family's other members are opaque .zdict byte blobs reconstructed from the segment header's in-band \"dct\" map, while this one is RDF and therefore travels as RDF (PIPELINE_SPINE §5) — the graph/medium-measurement corpus re-rooted into its graph/fanout twin. The gate keys the header-dict family on the .zdict suffix, so a .ttl under the same prefix falls to rdf-fanout by construction rather than by exception. One row of the gmeow:fanoutExtracts path-to-representative bijection the superset gate enforces."@x-gmeow-english ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/pipeline> ;
    gmeow:graphBoxRole gmeow:boxABox ;
    gmeow:extractsPath "generated/medium/dictionary-effect.ttl" ; gmeow:extractsMatch "exact" ;
    gmeow:extractsGraphFamily "rdf-fanout" ; gmeow:extractsForm "turtle" .

gmeow:fanout-medium-gmeow-core-v1 a gmeow:FanoutExtraction ;
    rdfs:label "fanout medium dictionary gmeow-core-v1"@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:definition "Fanout reconstruction row: the committed path generated/medium/gmeow-core-v1.zdict is rebuilt from the shipped gmeow.gts as the verbatim bytes of the \"gmeow-core-v1\" entry of the segment header's in-band \"dct\" map. One row of the gmeow:fanoutExtracts path-to-representative bijection the superset gate enforces."@x-gmeow-english ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/pipeline> ;
