# Expected-output inventory (gmeow:expectsGeneratedOutput) — the                #
# INDEPENDENTLY-AUTHORED completeness oracle: every non-terminal committed      #
# generated/ path the pipeline must produce, hand-authored (NOT carrier-emitted #
# like the opaque fanout rows) so a silently-dropped output HARD-fails the      #
# superset gate. Sorted; the two terminal bundles are excluded. See             #
# crates/pipeline/src/stages/superset.rs (read_expected_outputs).                #
# =========================================================================== #
