# ── logic: assertion carriers for this slice's own terms ────────────────────────
# The canonical logic: carriers for the characteristics and integrity conditions of the
# terms THIS slice owns. Each record names one of this slice's own properties or classes
# through a logic: RBox predicate; the native coherence gate joins the record to enforce
# the condition, and the OWL grounding view projects owl:FunctionalProperty (and friends)
# from it. Authored here rather than in the logic slice because the fact asserted is a
# fact about this slice's own term, and a grounding slice never depends on a non-grounding
# slice (docs/GROUNDING.md, the tier rule): the logic: assertion vocabulary is CONSUMED
# here (gmeow:sliceDependsOn logic), never owned.
#   logic:PropertyCharacteristicAssertion — logic:characterizes names the property, logic:characteristicSort its characteristic.

gmeow:stageImplFunctionality
    a owl:NamedIndividual ,
        logic:PropertyCharacteristicAssertion ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/pipeline> ;
    rdfs:label "stageImpl is functional"@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:definition "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:stageImpl is functional: each gmeow:PipelineStage binds to exactly one Rust Stage implementation in the STAGE_REGISTRY and the loader hard-fails when the key resolves to no implementation, so a stage carries a single registry-key value. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."@x-gmeow-english ;
    logic:characterizes gmeow:stageImpl ;
    logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty ;
    logic:formalizes gmeow:stageImpl ;
    gmeow:useWhen "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:stageImpl names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:stageImpl, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:scopeNote "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:stageImpl and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:stageImpl (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "gmeow:stageImplFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:stageImpl ."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:graphBoxRole gmeow:boxABox .

gmeow:executesStageFunctionality
    a owl:NamedIndividual ,
        logic:PropertyCharacteristicAssertion ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/pipeline> ;
    rdfs:label "executesStage is functional"@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:definition "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:executesStage is functional: a gmeow:StageExecution enacts exactly one gmeow:PipelineStage — one occurrence is a run of a single standing unit of work, so an execution bound to two stages is two executions, not one. This record is not a definition of the term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."@x-gmeow-english ;
    logic:characterizes gmeow:executesStage ;
    logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty ;
    logic:formalizes gmeow:executesStage ;
    gmeow:useWhen "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:executesStage names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:executesStage, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects owl:FunctionalProperty from it."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:scopeNote "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:executesStage and nothing else. It is not a definition of the term (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state its meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "gmeow:executesStageFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:executesStage ."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:graphBoxRole gmeow:boxABox .

